.TH DEBOS-TOOLBOX 1 "November 2026" "Debos - Toolbox 0.6.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
debos-toolbox \- all-in-one GTK toolbox for Debian Stable, Testing, Sid and LMDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B debos-toolbox
[\fB\-\-page\fR \fINAME\fR] [\fB\-\-startup\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Debos - Toolbox cleans, repairs, updates and customizes a Debian system. Every administrative
action is turned into a readable shell script that runs in the embedded console with
administrator rights obtained through pkexec, sudo or su. Output is recorded in
/var/log/debos-toolbox/tasks.log.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-page " " \fINAME\fR
Open a page directly, for example cleaner, updates, repositories, software, kernels or drivers.
.TP
.B \-\-startup
Run the health check used by the login monitor and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/debos-toolbox/settings.json
User settings.
.TP
.I /var/log/debos-toolbox/tasks.log
Log of all administrative tasks.
.TP
.I /var/backups/debos-toolbox/
Backups of APT sources, keys and other files changed by the program.
